TEXT 528 256 Left 2 ;Two-Stage CMOS Op-Amp (Exercise 5)\n \nDifferential Input Stage:\n  M1, M2: NMOS differential pair (W=50u, L=1u)\n  M3, M4: NMOS current mirror tail (W=20u, L=2u)\n  RBIAS: Sets bias current (~50uA)\n \nActive Load:\n  M5, M6: PMOS current mirror (W=50u, L=1u)\n \nOutput Stage:\n  M7: NMOS common-source (W=100u, L=1u)\n \nCompensation:\n  CC: Miller compensation capacitor (5pF)\n  CL: Load capacitance (10pF)
